{"title":"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/5/4d5268b25df102d5a449e383136904d128fe13b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50 - 2\\sqrt{x} = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"119\" height=\"21\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/1696703351c121554ea96247d0dcdc043694886a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 32 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 16 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 64 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 256 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/5/4d5268b25df102d5a449e383136904d128fe13b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50 - 2\\sqrt{x} = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"119\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/a/01af6225165b423d963defcd081f21cd94c82686.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2\\sqrt{x} = 18 - 50 = -32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"190\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/e/87eb38e713e8bf4759b139ce9c6971ce2cace1b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x} = \\frac{-32}{-2} = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"130\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/c/5cc2e1c409cb3bb09dcc377569c58f71ce2de8fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 16^{2} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 256}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"161\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley\">2025 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2